#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#634 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: This structure was not in the castle before!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#635 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: This is Himelmez's closed space. We blocked each area and aisle."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#636 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: We tried to break it down but it's really strong."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#637 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Step back. Let me try to dispel the magic."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#640 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: I think that part of closed space is broken down."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#641 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: I have never seen this closed space."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#642 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Himelmez hides stone chains in undead people's body."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#643 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Maybe this closed space is maintained with these stone chains."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#644 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: If you want to break it, you have to kill one of those who have a stone chain."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#645 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: But we can't recognize who has a stone chain so we have to purify everything."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#646 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: It is inexcusable behavior."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#647 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: I already exterminated all my soldiers and maybe more..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#648 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Commander..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#649 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Commander! You need to be strong."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#650 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Our enemy is not human."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#651 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Even though you deny it, they'll never turn back to human."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#652 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: ..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#653 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Well, let's go then."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#654 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: And you guys, just take a break and follow us."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#655 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: It could be hard fighting so stay strong."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#656 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Ok, it's time to begin Heinrich."
