#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#794 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: Gerhalt!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#795 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: What are you doing to my soldier Himelmez!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#796 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Hoo hoo, I already found a piece of Ymir's heart, Heinrich."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#797 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: If he did not bother me it would have been faster."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#798 (npctalk)
